#!/bin/bash
#BSUB -J sp_gex_sweep_R4
#BSUB -P acc_DiseaseGeneCell
#BSUB -q gpuexpress
#BSUB -m "lg05g29 lg03e15 lg05e04"
#BSUB -n 1
#BSUB -gpu num=1
#BSUB -R "rusage[mem=32000]"
#BSUB -W 03:00
#BSUB -L /bin/bash
#BSUB -o /sc/arion/work/huangl21/sp_project/logs/%J.%I.stdout
#BSUB -e /sc/arion/work/huangl21/sp_project/logs/%J.%I.stderr

set -euo pipefail
PROJECT_HOME=/sc/arion/work/huangl21/sp_project
GPU_ENV=/sc/arion/work/huangl21/conda_envs/omicverse-gpu
export CELLPOSE_LOCAL_MODELS_PATH=/sc/arion/work/huangl21/cellpose_models
export OMP_NUM_THREADS=${LSB_DJOB_NUMPROC:-1}
source ~/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh
conda activate "$GPU_ENV"
module load cuda || true
set -a
source "$PROJECT_HOME/config/paths.env"
set +a
export TMPDIR=/sc/arion/scratch/huangl21/sp_project/${LSB_JOBID:-manual}_gex_sweep
mkdir -p "$TMPDIR" "$PROJECT_HOME/logs"
export PYTHONPATH="$PROJECT_HOME/scripts:${PYTHONPATH:-}"

python -u "$PROJECT_HOME/scripts/16_gex_cellpose_parameter_sweep.py" \
  --input "$PROJECT_HOME/results/pilot_v2/SC000895-R4/cellpose_he/SC000895-R4_002um_cellpose_he.h5ad" \
  --output-dir "$PROJECT_HOME/results/pilot_v2/SC000895-R4/gex_parameter_sweep" \
  --mpp 0.3239732935 --gpu
